# Work Tracebook

Use `factorylog` for tasks that create durable outcomes. Start before making
changes, report meaningful milestones, and archive completed work. Preserve the
task ID returned by `factorylog start`. Leave blocked tasks open after reporting
the blocker. Do not record code, diffs, terminal output, secrets, scores, or
guessed progress percentages. Skip read-only answers and status checks.
